://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g298459-d23518213-r995045566?m\\u003d68573\\u0026staydates\\u003d2026_05_31_2026_06_01\\u0026uguests\\u003d1_2_0\\u0026supdv\\u003dunknown\\u0026supuc\\u003dPH\\u0026supul\\u003den\",[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/local-reviews/AJMZ0QeSe9ibNVY65MpgeQh70I370foM0-7tEPyVc9CIfSq5Ekli093sZJVPBoLD5d5qPK_2rw\\u003ds40-c-br100\",40,40]],\"a year ago\",[3,5],[[[1,\"I stayed at the hotel for nearly a week on a work trip. With six years in the hospitality industry, here’s my review:||Ambiance: The high-ceilinged entrance exudes elegance. The pool seems a bit dated but is still suitable for swimming. I didn’t use the gym.||Wi-Fi: Adequate for remote work. However, my husband had issues playing high-demand online games like Dota.||Breakfast: Disappointing. We paid ₱1,600 for two, as online bookings through platforms like Booking.com don’t include breakfast due to discounted rates. The limited food choices were underwhelming; the eggplant was tasty, but I’m allergic. The Spanish sardines seemed canned, and the waffles weren’t good. For ₱800 per person, the selection was minimal and unsatisfying.||Dinner: Overall, the food was delicious; breakfast was the only letdown.||Room: At night, when it’s very quiet, you can subtly hear other guests in adjacent rooms.||Customer Service: 8/10. The staff is courteous and knowledgeable, especially housekeeping. The front desk needed two reminders for my request, but overall, service was satisfactory.||Overall, it’s a pleasant place to stay, with nearby restaurants and a quiet environment suitable for walks. Improvements are needed, particularly regarding breakfast, but I plan to return, hoping for enhancements in that area.\",null,\"I stayed at the hotel for nearly a week on a work trip. With six years in the hospitality industry, here’s my review:||Ambiance: The high-ceilinged entrance exudes elegance. The pool seems a bit dated but is still suitable for swimming.\",false,true]]],\"https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g298459-d23518213-r995045566?m\\u003d68573\\u0026staydates\\u003d2026_05_31_2026_06_01\\u0026uguests\\u003d1_2_0\\u0026supdv\\u003dunknown\\u0026supuc\\u003dPH\\u0026supul\\u003den\",null,null,null,\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURvXzZEZ2tBRRAB\",\"\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,false],\"\",[[1779124763203547,40278424,1178305943],null,null,null,null,[[2]]]],[[\"Trip.com\",null,[\"https://www.gstatic.com/travel-hotels/branding/b8089cb0-34b4-458c-8749-9bc4614baba4.png\",24,24],2,84],[[\"Trip.com Member\",\"https://www.trip.com/hotels/detail?hotelid\\u003d78103878\\u0026Allianceid\\u003d810504\\u0026Sid\\u003d1394411\\u0026utm_medium\\u003dcpc\\u0026utm_campaign\\u003dHPA\\u0026utm_source\\u003dgoogle#review\",[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/local-reviews/AJMZ0QeCck1CfANpZm9bBk3PHtP97Kh9k25HZfvq9yAWlN3BaIyjSHUPEfWkhAJmuYiJsH-_6g\\u003ds40-c-br100\",40,40]],\"a year ago\",[5,5],[[[1,\"This is an excellent hotel. The staff were amazing and nothing was too much trouble. Breakfast was good. Breakfast buffet if hotel is high occupancy,  A la carte if low occupancy but both good. Cannot fault this hotel. Very peaceful as located in a giant park. Highly recommend.\",null,\"This is an excellent hotel. The staff were amazing and nothing was too much trouble. Breakfast was good. Breakfast buffet if hotel is high occupancy,  A la carte if low occupancy but both good. Cannot fault this hotel. Very peaceful as located in a giant park. Highly recommend.\",false,false]]],\"https://www.trip.com/hotels/detail?hotelid\\u003d78103878\\u0026Allianceid\\u003d810504\\u0026Sid\\u003d1394411\\u0026utm_medium\\u003dcpc\\u0026utm_campaign\\u003dHPA\\u0026utm_source\\u003dgoogle#review\",null,null,null,\"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNZZ08zNDFRRRAB\",\"\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,false],\"\",[[1779124763203547,40278424,1178305943],null,null,null,null,[[3]]]],[[\"Google\",null,[\"https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_48dp.png\",24,24],1,-1],[