[["wrb.fr","ocp93e","[[[[[\"Google\",null,[\"https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_48dp.png\",24,24],1,-1],[[\"Roscel Isip\",\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104981743689922150696?hl\\u003den-US\",[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXtFpCNU7O-XhfTEf-Wsw7KFKq7-cmvL0-02qchBF6Gspk7_ZIB\\u003ds40-c-rp-mo-br100\",40,40]],\"2 months ago\",[1,5],[[[1,\"Very disappointing stay. Definitely not worth the price.\\u003cbr\\u003eI gave Sotogrande another chance after a bad experience in Baguio, hoping it was a one-off. Unfortunately, my stay at Sotogrande Davao proved otherwise.\\u003cbr\\u003eThe room maintenance was very poor. The shower is inside a bathtub, and when I took a bath, the drain wasn’t functioning. The hot water was intermittent. The electric kettle continuously boiled without stopping, which is a safety concern. I reported these to the front desk, but the staff was disorganized and unclear about what action would be taken. I had to keep asking for updates.\\u003cbr\\u003eWhen housekeeping arrived, I was told to just manually lift the broken drain knob myself. They admitted it was broken, yet I was the one expected to adjust. The kettle issue was also initially dismissed until I insisted it be replaced.\\u003cbr\\u003eThey transferred me to a “fully functional” replacement room. However, while the shower drain worked, the sink drain didn’t. At that point, I was too exhausted from meetings to complain again.\\u003cbr\\u003eFor the price they charge, this level of maintenance is unacceptable.\\u003cbr\\u003eDining was another disappointment. On our first night, the restaurant had no Pale Pilsen, no red wine, and no white wine. Basic beverages were unavailable. It was also warm inside. We ended up leaving to find dinner elsewhere, which was inconvenient given the hotel’s location.\\u003cbr\\u003eBreakfast was advertised as buffet but was served plated on our first day without prior notice. There was also an overly chatty restaurant staff member who didn’t seem to pick up on social cues that we preferred a quiet morning.\\u003cbr\\u003eLastly, this is the only hotel I’ve experienced that requires an “exit pass” after checkout while they inspect the room. It felt more like a hospital discharge process than a hotel stay.\\u003cbr\\u003eOverall, very poor maintenance standards and inconsistent service. I would not recommend staying here.\",null,\"Very disappointing stay. Definitely not worth the price.\\u003cbr\\u003eI gave Sotogrande another chance after a bad experience in Baguio, hoping it was\",false,true]]],\"\",null,[2],[[1,[1,5]],[4,[1,5]],[5,[1,5]]],\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21jd1NXRmxaMlYzTUVsbWFpMVZjR3BLTkVSeE1sRRAB\",\"\",null,null,null,null,[[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ANxoTn0_IUIWF0YJ9UutsLBbdV5HyDPIXYmjR4XLV59CyiKzAJUUUAd-gRf06qrJ2yvCPkPrvVfuD8BYOcCCTdsrDspKZ08jHAZr1cT5hKsYkaiWZ7LtfuLwPKTZcjMvigqSUdT6qVpbdcb02vY\\u003dk-no\",5712,4284,null,[0,null,false,false],null,null,null,null,null,[\"Roscel Isip\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXtFpCNU7O-XhfTEf-Wsw7KFKq7-cmvL0-02qchBF6Gspk7_ZIB\\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-br100\",\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104981743689922150696?hl\\u003den-US\"],null,null,3,[10,\"CIABIhA_6E19qSWvpn10VavzISjz\"],null,10,[null,[10,\"CIABIhA_6E19qSWvpn10VavzISjz\"],[10,3,[5712,4284]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[\"Sotogrande Davao Hotel\"]],[null,[[[\"Roscel Isip\"],\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104981743689922150696?hl\\u003den-US\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXtFpCNU7O-XhfTEf-Wsw7KFKq7-cmvL0-02qchBF6Gspk7_ZIB\\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-br100\",null,null,\"104981743689922150696\"]]],[[[2],[[null,null,null,null,1]]]],[2,null,null,null,null,[null,null,null,[7,3]],null,null,[2026,2,19,9,null,null,null,null,[\"2 months ago\"]]],[\"//www.google.com/local/imagery/report/?cb_client\\u003dunknown_client.hotels_search\\u0026image_key\\u003d!1e10!2sCIABIhA_6E19qSWvpn10VavzISjz\\u0026fid\\u003d0x0:0x3544bafb0adf5ecd