duct/1x/googleg_48dp.png\",24,24],1,-1],[[\"Alain Sarmiento\",\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114919345132558024625?hl\\u003den-US\",[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVmOc5rkhU7ncdYLtvYB1-raxjGgbRiZzXYM9u9Hrd8BC0JDs8\\u003ds40-c-rp-mo-br100\",40,40]],\"5 months ago\",[1,5],[[[1,\"Wow, this hotel is really the worst. First, the air-conditioning in the suite was extremely hot—even with two units running. Second, the Wi-Fi had no signal, and when it did, it kept disconnecting.\\u003cbr\\u003eThen in the morning, I woke up early at 4 AM to go jogging, and to my shock, there was no water in the bathroom when I went to brush my teeth. Thank God there was a small bottle of mineral water, so I used that instead.\\u003cbr\\u003eBut here’s the worst part: after finishing my coffee, I needed to use the bathroom, but there was still no water—not even enough to flush. What a nightmare experience.\",null,\"Wow, this hotel is really the worst. First, the air-conditioning in the suite was extremely hot—even with two units running. Second, the Wi-Fi had no signal, and when it did, it kept disconnecting.\",false,true]]],\"\",null,[2],null,\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOTmVUUkVTa054V1daUFdGTjFTemhYVVZKNU5HYxAB\",\"\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,false],\"https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOTmVUUkVTa054V1daUFdGTjFTemhYVVZKNU5HYxAB\\u0026t\\u003d1\\u0026entityid\\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOTmVUUkVTa054V1daUFdGTjFTemhYVVZKNU5HYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOTmVUUkVTa054V1daUFdGTjFTemhYVVZKNU5HYxILMGQ4V1YxTC1EMmgaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09rTk5lVFJFU2tOeFdXWlBXRk4xU3poWFVWSjVOR2MSCzBkOFdWMUwtRDJoIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARzV7fCvu6RDUqCzBkOFdWMUwtRDJo\\u0026wv\\u003d1\\u0026d\\u003d286732321\",[[1779124778134035,40278763,3056375155],null,null,null,null,[[5]]]],[[\"Google\",null,[\"https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_48dp.png\",24,24],1,-1],[[\"Gladys Logroño\",\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib